limit: The first-generation nums/ module has emit*.go files; they were outside the study.
at: 2026-11-24
by: r1/nums-model

n: 3.2.1.2
name: two-generations
kind: observation
is: http/model holds two models. The working one is Node_t and IdScope_t behind the globals cache_g and config; commit 2f9ab62 of 2023-03-30 prefixed its methods touching the global cache with Cache_, with gaps at HEAD. The newer one, interfaces.go (590 lines) and implementation.go (2,772 lines), first appears in that commit, mid-refactor at HEAD.
status: observed
