n: 3.2.1.3
name: role-bits-and-families
kind: observation
is: The newer model's NodeKind_e is a bit set: Delimitor, Whitespace, Comment, Decl, Use, Keyword, Blueprint, Recipe, Cell, combined as in NodeKind_RecipeDecl = Decl | Recipe. Blueprint, recipe and cell each have a declaration interface and a use interface. The cell kinds are Empty, Global, Parameter, Local, Register, Resource, Sync and Literal.
status: observed
