n: 3.2.1.4
name: package-and-expression-shapes
kind: observation
is: In the newer model a package is one blueprint of kind Package plus one block recipe named <package>$global. Each expression and statement instantiates one of 16 built-in recipe templates, left by 17 registrations (such as $binary, $call, $loop). A function signature is a blueprint $func.<name> with children $input, $output and, for a method, $this.
status: observed
src: 2.5.4#885-889 2.5.4#246-262 2.5.4#276-278 2.5.4#596-618 2.5.4#1682-1688
