n: 3.2.2.4
name: node-id-is-position
kind: observation
is: A syntax node's id in http/ is NodeLocation_t {Start byte, Level}, Level being the depth below the file root. Across files the id is the string folder.file.start.level, which the HTML view carries as an attribute, for example nid='1.0.8.2'. The id needs no table, and a parent and a child that start at the same byte differ by level.
status: observed
