at: 2026-11-24
by: r1/nums-model

n: 3.2.3.4
name: resolution-order
kind: observation
is: The old model labels a node in this order: resolve the parent; try the symbol's naming rules; try content matchers; open an anonymous scope if the symbol is a naming context; look the identifier up through the scope chain; else take the symbol's possible labels and prune by operator arity and the parent's root. Several labels may remain.
status: observed
src: 2.5.6#873-970 2.5.6#1145-1209 2.5.29#14
limit: A label confidence factor is planned in the design note and absent in code.
