is: Let go of assertions that only log and of debug prints whose arguments are evaluated on production paths: in NUMS.Go a broken invariant fails no test, and two committed tests (TestGo_IdScope_BP and Test_Query_File_api_test) panic inside the argument of a disabled debug print.
status: inferred
conf: high
from: 3.2.4.3 3.2.4.2
at: 2026-11-24
by: r1/nums-model

n: 3.2.9.5
name: two-models-one-package
kind: finding
is: Let go of keeping two half-overlapping models in one package: in NUMS.Go the newer model never reached the older one's coverage, and at HEAD it detects a package and nothing below it while the older model carries 22 of the 23 passing tests.
status: inferred
conf: mid
from: 3.2.1.2 3.2.1.5 3.2.1.6 3.2.4.2
at: 2026-11-24
by: r1/nums-model

n: 3.2.9.6
name: unpublished-fork-dependency
kind: finding
is: Let go of a build that depends on an unpublished sibling checkout: the tree-sitter fork NUMS.Go points at is absent, and nothing in the repository compiles on a clean machine.
status: inferred
